release_all_handles
Release all handles and their resources allocated by NPI Language routines.
The NPI Language API release_all_handles releases all handles in the Language model.
This includes handles set as "permanent" (see set_permanent).
The routine returns 1 (true) on success.
It returns 0 (false) on failure.

