TrcOption
class lang.TrcOption(edge_check=True, trc_val_idx=False,
report_data=True, report_control=True, trc_stmt_prop=False,
ignore_port_dir=False, show_flatten=False)
Class for option of trace rules. Following are the members:
* edge_check (bool): Only report the edge trigger signals of event control.
* trc_var_idx (bool): Treat the signal of variable index as driver.
* report_data (bool): Report the data signals.
* report_control (bool): Report the control signals.
* trc_stmt_prop (bool): Trace through statement.

* ignore_port_dir (bool): Ignore non cell's port direction when tracing driver or load.
* show_flatten (bool): Show flatten packed struct signal bit instead of struct member
name.
