Limitation: Only one database can be opened in a single session.
To open another database, close the current database first.
All L0 APIs/TCLs work only when CRDB is opened by npi_crdb_open.

npi_crdb_close - Closes the loaded CRDB and returns the memory
npi_crdb_save_as - Saves currently loaded CRDB into another file name

