Vh Exit, Vh Next
The vh exit and vh next are sequential statements. Their conditional expressions is
obtained by applying one-to-one method npiVhCondExpr.

process (a) begin
fLoop: for loopCnt in cv downto 30 loop
-- npiVhExit
es: exit fLoop when a(loopCnt)='0';
-- npiVhNext
if (loopCnt = cv) then
next;

For the exit statement above, applying one-to-one method npiVhCondExpr obtains
"a(loopCnt)='0'".
For the next statement above, applying one-to-one method npiVhCondExpr obtains
"loopCnt = cv".

