Interprocess Communication with Socket Client
The npiSocketClient APIs provide a simple means for the client process to integrate with
the Tcl command language provided by the server process.
These APIs make it simple to establish a connection, send commands to and receive
event notifications from a command server.
The APIs transparently use sockets to handle communication between the server and
client processes.
