npi_nl_inst_handle_by_nl_name
Get the handle to an instance object by the given hierarchical scope name and
instance nl_name.
(nl_name is the object name returned from property npiNlName).

npiNlHandle npi_nl_inst_handle_by_nl_name ( char* scope_hier_name, char*
inst_nl_name, bool reset_flag = false );

Specify a character string or pointer to a string containing the full hierarchical name of a

inst_nl_name

Specify a character string or pointer to a string containing the nl_name of an instance
object to be obtained.

Specify a Boolean value specifying whether or not internal hash should be reset (true:
reset, false: no reset, default value: false).
The handle to an instance object.
end

{
// setup the character string for handles' nl_names

scopeHierName = "top.i_ff";
