A build() method must be implemented. Inside the method, each instance of the
register classes is created using the UVM class factory. Each register abstraction
class is then configured by calling its configure() method then built by calling its
build() method. This instantiates the register abstraction classes and configures them
at the proper address offset, access policy, etc…
