Monitor Example
The following example shows a simple monitor which has the following functions:
— The monitor collects bus informa tion through a virtual interface (xmi).
— The collected data is used in coverage collection and checking.
— The collected data is exported on an analysis port ( item_collected_port).
Actual code for collection is not shown in this ex ample. A complete example can be found in the UBus
example in ubus_master_monitor.sv.
